    <section class="hero">
      <h1>Shared Product Data Service for consumer analytics</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Comprehensive solution context for use as an input to a High-Level Solution Design</p>
      <p>This document restructures the available discovery material from a Data Solution Architecture perspective. It captures the business problem, current state, data semantics, requirements, proposed logical architecture, design decisions, risks, and delivery considerations.</p>
      <div class="callout excluded"><strong>Explicit exclusion:</strong> the Detailed Platform Attribute Mapping appendix is not included. References to Analytics Platform as the intended analytical platform remain because they are central to the requirement.</div>
