    <section class="section" id="src-solution-context-document-control">
      <h2>1. Document control and usage</h2>
      <div class="table-wrap"><table aria-label="Solution context - table 1"><tbody>
        <tr><th>Document purpose</th><td>Provide structured context and input for a High-Level Solution Design covering a unified analytical product catalogue for Consumer Data Science Function.</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Source</th><td><code>source-requirements-pack.pdf</code>, a 38-page screenshot-based requirements pack. Source pages 1-32 have been used; source pages 33-38, the detailed Analytics Platform mapping appendix, are excluded.</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Source status</th><td>The requirements page is explicitly described as a living document that may change during design and build.</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Primary author in source</th><td>Role Holder D.</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Intended audience</th><td>Data Solution Architect, Domain Architect, Data Engineering, consumer analytics Product, Data Science leads, Data Governance, Information Security, and technical delivery teams.</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Interpretation rule</th><td>Statements labelled as proposed or decision required are architectural interpretation, not approved source requirements.</td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
