    <section class="section" id="src-drd-request">
      <h2>2. Business request and problem statement</h2>
      <h3>Business request</h3>
      <p><span class="status confirmed">Confirmed</span> Create a unified, standardised product dimension/catalogue in Analytics Platform for three Consumer Data Science Function squads, replacing the fragmented analytical approach in which squads independently maintain product data through Document Database, Relational Database and Search Platform.</p>
      <h3>Problem statement</h3>
      <ul><li>Rich product data is distributed across Product Aggregation Service-derived stores and Analytics Platform.</li><li>Product Aggregation Service has not been piped into Analytics Platform.</li><li>Analytics Platform receives ERP, Product Lifecycle Platform and Product Information Platform data through a different path and lacks multiple rich attributes available online.</li><li>Squads independently clean, transform, snapshot and interpret product data.</li><li>Product identifiers are inconsistent and use six or more column names across systems.</li><li>Leading-zero removal and identifier meaning are poorly documented.</li><li>No consistent Data Quality Framework quality controls exist on consumer product-data pipelines.</li><li>Pipeline run and failure visibility is limited.</li></ul>
      <div class="diagram"><div class="diagram-title">Business problem chain</div>
        <pre class="mermaid">
