  SPLIT["Product data follows separate<br>operational and analytical paths"] --&gt; STORES["Squad-specific stores<br>Document Database, Relational Database, Search Platform"]
  STORES --&gt; DUP["Duplicate ingestion, cleaning<br>and identifier logic"]
  DUP --&gt; FRICTION["Slow discovery and repeated<br>engineering requests"]
  DUP --&gt; RISK["Inconsistent joins, history<br>and model inputs"]
  GAP["Rich Product Aggregation Service data<br>not centrally available in Analytics Platform"] --&gt; STORES
