      <h3>Missing business definitions</h3>
      <ul><li>Active product, available product, in-stock product and saleable product.</li><li>Product start/end dates and the time zone/business date used for history.</li><li>Master category and master breadcrumb selection.</li><li>Country/market precedence and fallback.</li><li>Deleted, recycled and reassigned identifier handling.</li><li>Historical correction and late-arriving update rules.</li><li>Required values and definitions for critical attributes.</li></ul>
