        <tr><td class="id">FR-10</td><td>The solution shall retain data relating to products that are no longer available where required for model training.</td><td><span class="status partial">Partial</span></td><td>Retention, deletion and legal/governance rules.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="id">FR-11</td><td>The solution shall support relevant country-specific product context.</td><td><span class="status partial">Partial</span></td><td>Required markets, fallback and country-specific field rules.</td></tr>
