      <ul><li>Requirements approval is required from the sponsor/key business stakeholder and Architect and/or Technical Lead.</li><li>Design Authority approval may be required for major changes.</li><li>Data Governance artefacts are required for new data sharing, classification and access/DAM-package changes.</li><li>Information Security involvement must be confirmed with the TPM/Technical Lead.</li></ul>
      <div class="diagram"><div class="diagram-title">Required approval path</div>
        <pre class="mermaid">
flowchart LR
