      </div>
      <h3>Missing governance and security requirements</h3>
      <ul><li><span class="tbd">Data classification.</span></li><li><span class="tbd">Permitted consumers and purpose-of-use restrictions.</span></li><li><span class="tbd">Access roles, approval workflow and revocation.</span></li><li><span class="tbd">Encryption and key-management requirements.</span></li><li><span class="tbd">Audit logging and retention.</span></li><li><span class="tbd">Source credential and secret-management requirements.</span></li><li><span class="tbd">Data residency or cross-border restrictions.</span></li><li><span class="tbd">Privacy assessment and confirmation that no personal data is included.</span></li><li><span class="tbd">Contract/schema change notification and deprecation obligations.</span></li></ul>
    </section>

