        <tr><td class="id">AC-01</td><td>Each of the three named Data Science squads can access the agreed analytical product data.</td><td>Access method, environment, consumer list and evidence format.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="id">AC-02</td><td>The approved critical Product Aggregation Service fields are present and documented.</td><td>Approved field inventory, null thresholds and source reconciliation.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="id">AC-03</td><td>Article, SKU, Product Information Platform and other approved identifier mappings follow documented rules.</td><td>Test dataset, expected results, uniqueness and temporal rules.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="id">AC-04</td><td>ERP buying and Product Information Platform selling hierarchy context is available as required.</td><td>Required levels, relationship completeness and historical behaviour.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="id">AC-05</td><td>A daily snapshot is available for every business date in the approved retention period.</td><td>Retention, publication deadline, exceptions and backfill start.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="id">AC-06</td><td>A consumer can reconstruct the agreed product state for a specified historical date.</td><td>Included domains and definitions of active/in-stock.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="id">AC-07</td><td>Critical data-quality checks run and their results are visible.</td><td>Rules, thresholds, severities and publication policy.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="id">AC-08</td><td>Pipeline freshness, status and failures are visible to the responsible owner.</td><td>Named owner, metrics, alerts and targets.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="id">AC-09</td><td>Data Catalogue documents the agreed fields, definitions, ownership and lineage.</td><td>Metadata checklist and acceptance authority.</td></tr>
        <tr><td class="id">AC-10</td><td>Each squad validates representative model use cases before migration.</td><td>Models, comparison measures, tolerances and sign-off authority.</td></tr>
      </tbody></table></div>
      <div class="callout warning"><strong>Not yet testable:</strong> all acceptance criteria require completion of the missing thresholds, field lists, owners and evidence methods before approval.</div>
    </section>

