<div class="wrap source-main"><section class="hero"><h1>Canonical Glossary - Draft</h1><p>Phase 1 terminology consolidation. Terms are not canonical until approved by the accountable Data Owner and source owners.</p><p><span class="status draft">Draft - not approved</span> <span class="status known">Known</span> <span class="status partial">Partial</span> <span class="status missing">Missing evidence</span> <span class="status conflict">Conflict</span></p><div class="gap"><strong>Evidence rule:</strong> red items are not available from the supplied material and have not been invented.</div></section><section class="section"><h2>1. Canonical terminology register</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table aria-label="03 - Canonical glossary - table 1"><thead><tr><th>Term</th><th>Current source-supported definition</th><th>Canonical status</th><th>Missing decision</th></tr></thead><tbody>
