<tr><td>Product Aggregation Service</td><td>API/service combining enriched product, inventory, price, reviews, navigation, promotions and specialist-category data.</td><td><span class="status known">Known</span></td><td>Approved analytical-source role.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Product Information Platform</td><td>Product Information Management system where product content is authored and maintained.</td><td><span class="status known">Known</span></td><td>Authoritative fields and hierarchy contract.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Analytics Platform</td><td>Central analytical data platform/warehouse used by Data Science.</td><td><span class="status known">Known</span></td><td>Target layer and product operating pattern.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Product Information Platform ID</td><td>Product-level ID, usually standard-prefixed; alternate type prefixes prefixes also occur.</td><td><span class="status partial">Partially canonical</span></td><td>Type, uniqueness, lifecycle and source field.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Article ID</td><td>Colour-level identifier; also Generic Article, Product Variant ID, article number or product-colour ID.</td><td><span class="status partial">Common working grain</span></td><td>Approved canonical name/type and temporal uniqueness.</td></tr>
