could prevent or delay migration?</h4><p><strong>Your answer:</strong></p><p>[Enter response]</p><p>Illustrative example - replace or confirm</p><p>“Migration would be delayed by missing country saleability, unresolved clickstream joins, insufficient historical coverage, model-release freezes or the absence of an agreed operational support owner.”</p><h4>Question 15.4 — When can redundant assets be decommissioned?</h4><p><strong>Your answer:</strong></p><p>[Enter response]</p><p>Illustrative example - replace or confirm</p><p>“An analytical asset may be retired after its consumers have signed off, two successful production cycles have completed, rollback has remained available for four weeks and its owner confirms that no undocumented dependencies remain.”</p><h3>Part K — Decisions and approval</h3><h3>16. Open decisions</h3><div class="table-label">Table 13</div><div class="table-wrap"><table aria-label="Stakeholder requirements baseline questionnaire - table 13"><tr><th><p><strong>ID</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Decision</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Options or positions</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Owner</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Due date</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Outcome/evidence</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>D-01</p></td><td><p>Approved source by attribute domain</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>D-02</p></td><td><p>Canonical grain and multi-grain outputs</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>D-03</p></td><td><p>Two- versus three-year retention</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>D-04</p></td><td><p>Historical correction semantics</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>D-05</p></td><td><p>Typed fields versus extended attributes</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>D-06</p></td><td><p>Quality-failure publication policy</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>D-07</p></td><td><p>Consumer migration gates</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr></table></div><h4>Question 16.1 — Are there approval conditions or final comments?</h4><p><strong>Your answer:</strong></p><p>[Enter response]</p><p>Illustrative example - replace or confirm</p><p>“Approval is conditional on confirming the Product Aggregation Service interface as a supported source, agreeing three-year storage cost and demonstrating the Article-to-clickstream mapping during the proof of concept.”</p><h3>17. Approval record</h3><div class="table-label">Table 14</div><div class="table-wrap"><table aria-label="Stakeholder requirements baseline questionnaire - table 14"><tr><th><p><strong>Approval role</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Name</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Decision</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Conditions</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Date</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>Business requirements owner</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Approve/Conditional/Reject]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Data Product Owner</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Approve/Conditional/Reject]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Consumer Team A acceptance owner</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Approve/Conditional/Reject]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Consumer Team B acceptance owner</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Approve/Conditional/Reject]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Consumer Team C acceptance owner</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Approve/Conditional/Reject]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Architecture/Technical Lead</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Approve/Conditional/Reject]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr></table></div><h4>Baseline declaration</h4><p>The signatories confirm that this document accurately represents the requirements known at the stated version. Remaining uncertainties are explicitly recorded with accountable owners and due dates.</p><p>Approval authorises progression into detailed solution design. It does not by itself approve production implementation, expenditure or decommissioning.</p><h3>Appendix A — Detailed attribute inventory</h3><p>Copy rows as required.</p><div class="table-label">Table 15</div><div class="table-wrap"><table aria-label="Stakeholder requirements baseline questionnaire - table 15"><tr><th><p><strong>Attribute</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Business definition</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Priority</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Grain</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Country</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Current source</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>History required</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Blocking use case/owner</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Must/Should/Could]</p></td><td><p>[Product/Article/SKU]</p></td><td><p>[Region A/Region B/Region C/All]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Current/Period]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Must/Should/Could]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Must/Should/Could]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td></tr></table></div><p><strong>Example row:</strong></p><div class="table-label">Table 16</div><div class="table-wrap"><table aria-label="Stakeholder requirements baseline questionnaire - table 16"><tr><th><p><strong>Attribute</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Business definition</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Priority</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Grain</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Country</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Current source</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>History required</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Blocking use case/owner</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>saleability</p></td><td><p>Whether a SKU can be sold in the specified market at the effective time</p></td><td><p>Must</p></td><td><p>SKU-country</p></td><td><p>Region A and Region B</p></td><td><p>Product Aggregation Service/Inventory domain</p></td><td><p>[agreed history period] daily</p></td><td><p>Availability-aware recommendations / Consumer Team B Lead</p></td></tr></table></div><h3>Appendix B — Evidence and terminology log</h3><div class="table-label">Table 17</div><div class="table-wrap"><table aria-label="Stakeholder requirements baseline questionnaire - table 17"><tr><th><p><strong>Reference or term</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Type</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Location/owner</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>What it supports or definition required</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Status</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>Product</p></td><td><p>Glossary</p></td><td><p>[Enter owner]</p></td><td><p>Define permitted grains and usage</p></td><td><p>Pending</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Article</p></td><td><p>Glossary</p></td><td><p>[Enter owner]</p></td><td><p>Confirm colour-level entity</p></td><td><p>Pending</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>SKU</p></td><td><p>Glossary</p></td><td><p>[Enter owner]</p></td><td><p>Confirm size-level entity</p></td><td><p>Pending</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Saleability</p></td><td><p>Glossary</p></td><td><p>[Enter owner]</p></td><td><p>Define country and time semantics</p></td><td><p>Pending</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Availability</p></td><td><p>Glossary</p></td><td><p>[Enter owner]</p></td><td><p>Define source, grain and time semantics</p></td><td><p>Pending</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>[Document/dataset/API]</p></td><td><p>Evidence</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Enter]</p></td><td><p>[Verified/Pending]</p></td></tr></table></div><h3>Example terminology entry</h3><p><strong>Term:</strong> Saleability</p><p><strong>Example definition:</strong> “A country-specific indication that a SKU is permitted and operationally able to be sold through the relevant digital channel at a stated effective time.”</p><p><strong>Required owner:</strong> Commerce/Product Aggregation Service domain owner</p><p><strong>Remaining questions:</strong> Does saleability incorporate stock, channel restrictions, publication status and price validity, or are these separate concepts?</p><h3>Appendix C — Baseline completion checklist</h3><p>The requirements baseline is ready for HLD when:</p><ul><li>[ ] All three Data Science teams have prioritised their use cases.</li><li>[ ] In-scope and out-of-scope boundaries are agreed.</li><li>[ ] Product, Article and SKU terminology is defined.</li><li>[ ] Identifier normalisation and mapping requirements are agreed.</li><li>[ ] Critical first-release attributes are identified.</li><li>[ ] Country and hierarchy requirements are agreed.</li><li>[ ] Historical meaning, retention and restatement rules are agreed.</li><li>[ ] Freshness and publication deadlines are measurable.</li><li>[ ] Critical quality controls and failure behaviour are defined.</li><li>[ ] Product, technical, source and acceptance owners are named.</li><li>[ ] Migration and decommissioning conditions are measurable.</li><li>[ ] Every unresolved decision has an owner and due date.</li><li>[ ] The consolidated baseline has received the required approvals.</li></ul></div>
