    DOCSTORE --&gt;|"Daily snapshot"| ANALYTICS_PLATFORM</pre><p>Logical flow: Product Information Platform -&gt; CONTENT_API; STOCK_API -&gt; GATEWAY; PRICE -&gt; GATEWAY; PROMO -&gt; GATEWAY; REV -&gt; GATEWAY; CATEGORY_API -&gt; GATEWAY; SPECIALIST -&gt; GATEWAY; ERP -&gt; Analytics Platform; Product Information Platform -&gt; Analytics Platform; GATEWAY -&gt; DOCSTORE; GATEWAY -&gt; PG; GATEWAY -&gt; ES; DOCSTORE -&gt; Analytics Platform</p><h3>Current-state caution</h3><p>Product Aggregation Service is a rich aggregated representation, but it does not automatically follow that Product Aggregation Service is the originating authority for every field it exposes.</p><p>The matrix must distinguish:</p><ul><li>Attributes authored in Product Information Platform.</li><li>Attributes authored in ERP or Product Lifecycle Platform.</li><li>Attributes owned by inventory, price, promotions, reviews or navigation.</li><li>Attributes calculated or decorated within Product Aggregation Service.</li><li>Attributes calculated specifically for analytical consumption.</li></ul><h3>5. Decision status</h3><p>Use one of the following values.</p><div class="table-label">Table 2</div><div class="table-wrap"><table aria-label="Attribute-authority matrix - table 2"><tr><th><p><strong>Status</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Meaning</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>Proposed</p></td><td><p>Recommended based on current evidence but not approved.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Confirmed</p></td><td><p>Business meaning, source, interface and ownership have been approved.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Partially confirmed</p></td><td><p>Some elements are approved, but source, interface, history or ownership remains unresolved.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Conflict</p></td><td><p>More than one source claims authority or values do not reconcile.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Missing</p></td><td><p>No authoritative source or owner has been identified.</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Not required</p></td><td><p>Attribute is not nee