ample - replace or confirm</p><p>“Review score requires daily history if used as a training feature. Historical image URLs are not required in release one.”</p><h3>7.6 Analytical and operational metadata</h3><div class="table-label">Table 10</div><div class="table-wrap"><table aria-label="Attribute-authority matrix - table 10"><tr><th><p><strong>ID</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Attribute</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Proposed authority</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Purpose</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Status</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>MET-01</p></td><td><p>Source system</p></td><td><p>Catalogue ingestion process</p></td><td><p>Lineage and reconciliation</p></td><td><p>Proposed</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>MET-02</p></td><td><p>Source interface/version</p></td><td><p>Source contract and ingestion process</p></td><td><p>Contract traceability</p></td><td><p>Proposed</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>MET-03</p></td><td><p>Source updated timestamp</p></td><td><p>Originating source</p></td><td><p>Point-in-time semantics</p></td><td><p>Proposed</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>MET-04</p></td><td><p>Ingested timestamp</p></td><td><p>Catalogue ingestion process</p></td><td><p>Operational lineage</p></td><td><p>Proposed</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>MET-05</p></td><td><p>Business date</p></td><td><p>Catalogue publication process</p></td><td><p>Historical consumption</p></td><td><p>Proposed</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>MET-06</p></td><td><p>Published timestamp</p></td><td><p>Catalogue publication process</p></td><td><p>Freshness measurement</p></td><td><p>Proposed</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>MET-07</p></td><td><p>Batch/run ID</p></td><td><p>Orchestration process</p></td><td><p>Replay and investigation</p></td><td><p>Proposed</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>MET-08</p></td><td><p>Contract version</p></td><td><p>Data Product Owner</p></td><td><p>Consumer compatibility</p></td><td><p>Proposed</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>MET-09</p></td><td><p>Record hash</p></td><td><p>Catalogue conformance process</p></td><td><p>Cha