g>Column</strong></p></th><th><p><strong>Example</strong></p></th></tr><tr><td><p>Attribute ID</p></td><td><p>COM-03</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Published name</p></td><td><p>sku_is_saleable</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Business definition</p></td><td><p>Whether a SKU is permitted and operationally able to be sold in the specified country and channel at the effective time</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Example value</p></td><td><p>true</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Grain</p></td><td><p>SKU-country</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Country context</p></td><td><p>Region A and Region B separately</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Business authority</p></td><td><p>Commerce/Product Aggregation Service domain owner</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>System of record</p></td><td><p>Composite of product publication and commerce eligibility sources</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Approved interface</p></td><td><p>Supported Product Aggregation Service product contract</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Current analytical source</p></td><td><p>Team B Document Database and Team C Relational Database</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Transformation</p></td><td><p>No transformation at SKU grain; Article-level value derived separately</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Source precedence</p></td><td><p>Product Aggregation Service contract wins over squad-maintained copies</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Refresh frequency</p></td><td><p>Daily for release one</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Source effective timestamp</p></td><td><p>Product Aggregation Service source-update timestamp</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Deletion behaviour</p></td><td><p>Retain history; remove from active view after effective deletion</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>History requirement</p></td><td><p>[agreed history period] of daily state</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Nullability rule</p></td><td><p>Must not be null for active Region A or Region B SKUs</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Validity rule</p></td><td><p>Boolean only; country must be present</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>Quality threshold</p></td><td><p>At least 99.9% of active SKUs populate